   "id": "math.multiply-sign-rules",
   "name": "Signs in multiplication",
   "explain": {
    "en": {
     "text": "Same signs give a positive product. Different signs give a negative product. Any number times 0 is 0. With many factors, an even number of negatives gives a positive answer; an odd number gives a negative answer."
